+def keyboard_target(element, record, source, tool):
+    """Patch 0013: the element text or keys must reach, or None for the focused element.
+
+    `source` is "named" (element_index) or "clicked" (the element the last click in that app aimed
+    at). Text aimed at one field must never land in another, so every refusal comes before anything
+    is sent.
